// A tracked region followed past the end of the video. The chain of steps
// stops at the last frame, and select clamps to it: past the end the last
// frame persists, and so does what is tracked on it, since the last step is a
// union of components of the last frame and touching it gives it back. Like
// a frame past the end, it is said, so that a specification that looks too
// far is told.
let video = load("merge")
let lesion = gt(intensity(frame(video,n)),127)
save "overflow" diamond(diamond(diamond(tracked(lesion,1))))
